  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s1.w14.node.direction.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "background",
        "assetId": "main.s1.w14.asset.background.001",
        "transition": "dissolve"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s1.w14.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "clearSprites"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s1.w14.node.direction.mimi.opening",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s1.w14.asset.sprite.mimi.serious",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w14.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w14.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "見てるだけなのに、なぜか私まで筋肉痛。そんな朝、受付に封筒、赤い社印。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w14.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w14.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "片道五日の距離を、また誰かが運んできた。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w14.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w14.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「名義変更申請の件、例外審査の結果、承認」……承認。三度、読み直した。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w14.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w14.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "最上級在籍のまま、名義を戻せる。いつでも、帰れるんだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w14.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w14.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "望んでた紙が、手の中で、妙に軽い。第一週の私なら、その場で万歳してた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w14.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w14.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "あの頃の私に、ちゃんと万歳させてあげたい。でも、今の気持ちは別の場所にある。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w14.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w14.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "承認書には、期限があった。「三十日以内に、手続きを」三十日。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w14.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w14.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "指を、折る。三十日後は——ちょうど、特訓の成果を試合で試す頃。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w14.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w14.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "昼、控室をのぞいた。封を解く練習をしてる、背中が三つ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w14.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w14.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "壁の亀裂は増えたけど、笑い声も増えた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w14.node.line.005c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w14.line.005c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "この背中、名義がマダムに戻ったら、誰が見るんだろう。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w14.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w14.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "夕方まで、承認書を胸ポケットに入れて働いた。紙一枚ぶん、ずっと胸が重い。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w14.node.line.006b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w14.line.006b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "重さの正体を、締めの時間に、やっと認めた。——私は、戻りたくないんだ。",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s1.w14.node.direction.mimi.shift.007",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s1.w14.asset.sprite.mimi.smile",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w14.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w14.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "受付の窓口で、取り下げの用紙をもらった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w14.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w14.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "ノノさんは何も聞かずに、黙って書式を出してくれた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w14.node.line.007c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w14.line.007c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "何も聞かないのは、ぜんぶ分かってる合図だ。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w14.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w14.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "取り下げます。私、この名義で——やりたいことが、できました。",
      "emotion": "resolve"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w14.node.line.009a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w14.line.009a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "取り下げの理由欄は、三行しかない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w14.node.line.009b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w14.line.009b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "やりたいこと(全員の全力を、興行に)を書いたら、はみ出した。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w14.node.line.009c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w14.line.009c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "別紙を付けた。事務員人生、初めて。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w14.node.line.010a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w14.line.010a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "書き終えると、ノノさんが判子置きを差し出した。自分の判を、まっすぐ押した。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w14.node.line.010b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w14.line.010b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "第一週の、一行ズレた判の、やり直しみたいに。",
      "emotion": "resolve"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w14.node.line.011a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w14.line.011a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "初めて、ノノさんの敬語が、少し崩れた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w14.node.line.011b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w14.line.011b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「……ようこそ、オーナー」それから慌てて言い直した。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w14.node.line.011c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w14.line.011c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「ようこそ、でいいんですよね？　今さらですけど」今さらです。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w14.node.line.011d",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w14.line.011d",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "でも、耳が熱くて、嬉しいです。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "effect",
      "id": "main.s1.w14.node.effect.001",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "sharedPoints",
          "amount": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "end",
      "id": "main.s1.w14.node.end.001",
      "mode": "return-to-week"
    }
  ],
